
  <main id="main">
    <section class="section qt">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div id="qtLoading" class="qt-state"><p class="muted">Loading your quote…</p></div>

        <div id="qtMissing" class="qt-state" hidden>
          <span class="eyebrow">Quote</span>
          <h1>I couldn't find that quote.</h1>
          <p class="lead">The link may be incomplete, or the quote may have been replaced. Message me and I’ll send the right one.</p>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp me</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/">Back to the site</a></div>
        </div>

        <article id="qtQuote" hidden>
          <p class="paid-banner" id="qtPaid" role="status" hidden></p>
          <span class="eyebrow" id="qtEyebrow">Quote</span>
          <h1 id="qtTitle">Your quote</h1>
          <p class="lead" id="qtLead"></p>

          <fieldset class="qt-options" id="qtOptions" hidden>
            <legend>Choose the option that suits you</legend>
            <div class="qt-options__list" id="qtOptionList"></div>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="qt-card">
            <div class="qt-card__head"><span class="mono" id="qtRef"></span><span class="qt-status" id="qtStatus"></span></div>
            <table class="qt-table">
              <caption class="sr-only">Quote line items</caption>
              <thead><tr><th scope="col">What I’ll build</th><th scope="col" class="qt-num">Price</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="qtItems"></tbody>
              <tfoot>
                <tr class="qt-total"><th scope="row">Total (fixed)</th><td class="qt-num" id="qtTotal"></td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row" id="qtDepositLabel">R500 deposit to start</th><td class="qt-num" id="qtDeposit"></td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row">Balance on completion</th><td class="qt-num" id="qtBalance"></td></tr>
              </tfoot>
            </table>
            <dl class="qt-meta">
              <div id="qtTimelineRow" hidden><dt>Timeline</dt><dd id="qtTimeline"></dd></div>
              <div id="qtNotesRow" hidden><dt>Notes</dt><dd id="qtNotes"></dd></div>
              <div id="qtValidRow" hidden><dt>Valid until</dt><dd id="qtValid"></dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p class="small muted">Third-party costs such as your domain are separate and agreed with you first. Nothing changes without your say-so. <a class="inline-link" href="terms">Terms &amp; deposit</a></p>
          </div>

          <form class="form qt-accept" id="qtAcceptForm" novalidate hidden>
            <h2>Accept this quote</h2>
            <p class="small muted" id="qtAcceptIntro"></p>
            <div class="form-row"><label for="qtName">Type your full name to accept</label><input type="text" id="qtName" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></div>
            <label class="qt-agree"><input type="checkbox" id="qtAgree" required /> <span>I accept the scope and price above and the <a class="inline-link" href="terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">terms</a>.</span></label>
            <p class="callsched__error" id="qtError" role="alert" hidden></p>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--large btn--full" id="qtAcceptBtn">Accept quote</button>
            <ul class="qt-secure" aria-label="About paying">
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg>Secure card payment through Yoco. I never see your card details.</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg>The R500 comes off your total, and you get a receipt.</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>Live within 7 days of you approving the design, or your first month of Care is free.</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10h18M5 10V19h14V10M12 4l9 6H3z"/></svg>Prefer EFT? Message me and I’ll send my bank details.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="qt-alt">
              <a class="inline-link" href="#" id="qtAsk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">I have a question</a>
              <button type="button" class="inline-link" id="qtDeclineOpen">Not for me</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <form class="form qt-decline" id="qtDeclineForm" novalidate hidden>
            <h2>No problem</h2>
            <p class="small muted">If you tell me why, I’ll learn from it — and if it's the price or the scope, I may be able to adjust.</p>
            <div class="form-row"><label for="qtReason">What didn't work? <span class="optional">optional</span></label><textarea id="qtReason" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. Over budget, timing, went with someone else"></textarea></div>
            <div class="btn-row"><button type="submit" class="btn btn--ghost">Decline the quote</button><button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="qtDeclineCancel">Back to the quote</button></div>
          </form>

          <div class="form qt-done" id="qtDone" hidden>
            <h2 id="qtDoneTitle"></h2>
            <p class="muted" id="qtDoneText"></p>
            <ol class="qt-track" id="qtTrack" aria-label="Your project's progress" hidden></ol>
            <div class="btn-row btn-row--center" id="qtDoneActions"></div>
          </div>

          <form class="form qt-content" id="qtContent" novalidate hidden>
            <h2>Send me what I need for your site</h2>
            <p class="small muted" id="qtContentIntro">The sooner I have these, the sooner you're live. Fill in what you can now: you can come back to this page and add more any time.</p>
            <div class="form-row"><label for="qcAbout">About your business <span class="optional">a few lines</span></label><textarea id="qcAbout" name="about" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. Family-run plumbers in Randburg since 2012. Fast call-outs, no mess."></textarea></div>
            <div class="form-row"><label for="qcServices">Your services and prices <span class="optional">one per line</span></label><textarea id="qcServices" name="services" rows="4" placeholder="e.g. Blocked drains, from R650&#10;Geyser replacement, from R4,500"></textarea></div>
            <div class="form-row"><label for="qcHours">Opening hours</label><textarea id="qcHours" name="hours" rows="2" placeholder="e.g. Mon–Fri 8:00–17:00, Sat 8:00–13:00"></textarea></div>
            <div class="form-row"><label for="qcArea">Address or areas you serve</label><input type="text" id="qcArea" name="area" placeholder="e.g. Randburg, Roodepoort and Northcliff" /></div>
            <div class="form-row"><label for="qcExtra">Anything else? <span class="optional">colours you like, sites you like, your Facebook page</span></label><textarea id="qcExtra" name="extra" rows="2"></textarea></div>
            <div class="form-row">
              <span class="qt-content__label">Your logo and photos <span class="optional">real photos of your work beat stock photos</span></span>
              <label class="qt-drop" for="qcFiles"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 16V4M7 9l5-5 5 5M4 16v3a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3"/></svg><span><b>Add photos or a PDF</b><small>JPG, PNG or PDF (a menu or price list is fine too)</small></span></label>
              <input type="file" id="qcFiles" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,application/pdf" multiple hidden />
              <ul class="qt-files" id="qcFileList" aria-live="polite"></ul>
            </div>
            <p class="callsched__error" id="qcError" role="alert" hidden></p>
            <p class="qt-saved" id="qcSaved" role="status" hidden></p>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--large btn--full" id="qcSave">Send to Re-Charge</button>
          </form>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script src="quote.js" defer></script>
